# Private entries (file-name axis, in addition to visibility frontmatter gate)
*.private.md

# Obsidian per-user vault config (tool repo now hosts entries/ as an
# Obsidian-compatible knowledge vault — personal workspace state must not be
# committed)
.obsidian/

# Community cache: if this repo is ever shallow-cloned as a community source
# under another checkout, its `community/` would be a nested cache of others'
# repos. Harmless to exclude defensively.
community/

